  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dad and Lily walk with Pip. Pip is a happy dog. \"Woof!\" says Pip. \"Look, Lily!\" says Dad. \"One cat!\" The cat is on a wall. Pip says, \"Woof, woof!\" The cat runs. Lily smiles.",
      "\"Two cows!\" says Lily. The cows are big. \"How many chickens?\" asks Dad. Lily counts. \"One, two, three, four, five, six!\" \"Six chickens!\" \"Good, Lily!\" says Dad. \"I like chickens,\" says Lily.",
      "A motorbike goes by. \"A red motorbike!\" Pip says, \"Woof!\" \"Look, a plane!\" says Lily. \"It is a small plane.\" \"Two planes!\" says Dad. Pip is happy. Lily is happy. Dad is happy too."
    ],
    "summary": "Dad and Lily walk with Pip. They count a cat, two cows, six chickens, a motorbike, and two planes.",
